{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433830313,"sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_00_jwteqcpngvpehia1oti2jv6a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/run/evidence/01-checkout-alert.md"},"output":"<path>/run/evidence/01-checkout-alert.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Synthetic evidence 01 — Customer error alert\n2: \n3: **Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:21 UTC\n4: \n5: **Source:** Checkout edge alert `eu-orders-submit-5xx`\n6: \n7: The five-minute 503 rate for `POST /orders/submit` in `eu-west-1` rose from below 0.2% to 21.8% for the window 09:17–09:21 UTC. The first 503 in the alert sample is at 09:17:11 UTC. Other regions remain below 0.2%. Affected customers receive the error before an order confirmation page appears.\n8: \n9: Sample failed request IDs: `req-eu-7314`, `req-eu-7340`, `req-eu-7392`. The alert records the HTTP status and route, but does not identify the failing component.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Synthetic evidence 01 — Customer error alert\n\n**Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:21 UTC\n\n**Source:** Checkout edge alert `eu-orders-submit-5xx`\n\nThe five-minute 503 rate for `POST /orders/submit` in `eu-west-1` rose from below 0.2% to 21.8% for the window 09:17–09:21 UTC. The first 503 in the alert sample is at 09:17:11 UTC. Other regions remain below 0.2%. Affected customers receive the error before an order confirmation page appears.\n\nSample failed request IDs: `req-eu-7314`, `req-eu-7340`, `req-eu-7392`. The alert records the HTTP status and route, but does not identify the failing component.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/run/evidence/01-checkout-alert.md","text":"# Synthetic evidence 01 — Customer error alert\n\n**Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:21 UTC\n\n**Source:** Checkout edge alert `eu-orders-submit-5xx`\n\nThe five-minute 503 rate for `POST /orders/submit` in `eu-west-1` rose from below 0.2% to 21.8% for the window 09:17–09:21 UTC. The first 503 in the alert sample is at 09:17:11 UTC. Other regions remain below 0.2%. Affected customers receive the error before an order confirmation page appears.\n\nSample failed request IDs: `req-eu-7314`, `req-eu-7340`, `req-eu-7392`. The alert records the HTTP status and route, but does not identify the failing component.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"run/evidence/01-checkout-alert.md","time":{"start":1791433830287,"end":1791433830304}},"id":"prt_119c6eefd0015EpVyOJmuBjr0H","sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","messageID":"msg_119c6e8570015Q0G1ogcITISRI"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433830429,"sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_r7s1ilykahu0syimhsmtxn3s","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/run/evidence/02-database-dashboard.md"},"output":"<path>/run/evidence/02-database-dashboard.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Synthetic evidence 02 — Payments database dashboard\n2: \n3: **Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:22 UTC\n4: \n5: **Source:** Dashboard panel `payments-postgres / connection acquisition`\n6: \n7: The panel shows connection acquisition wait p95 rising from 18 ms at 09:10 UTC to 760 ms at 09:18 UTC and 810 ms at 09:21 UTC. The panel's displayed query is `region=eu-west-1, service=*`, and its legend says `all payments clients`. The panel has no request IDs or per-service breakdown. The database's total connection count remains below its configured limit.\n8: \n9: The dashboard alone does not show which client experienced the long waits or whether the checkout requests reached a database client.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Synthetic evidence 02 — Payments database dashboard\n\n**Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:22 UTC\n\n**Source:** Dashboard panel `payments-postgres / connection acquisition`\n\nThe panel shows connection acquisition wait p95 rising from 18 ms at 09:10 UTC to 760 ms at 09:18 UTC and 810 ms at 09:21 UTC. The panel's displayed query is `region=eu-west-1, service=*`, and its legend says `all payments clients`. The panel has no request IDs or per-service breakdown. The database's total connection count remains below its configured limit.\n\nThe dashboard alone does not show which client experienced the long waits or whether the checkout requests reached a database client.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/run/evidence/02-database-dashboard.md","text":"# Synthetic evidence 02 — Payments database dashboard\n\n**Observed:** 2026-10-06 09:22 UTC\n\n**Source:** Dashboard panel `payments-postgres / connection acquisition`\n\nThe panel shows connection acquisition wait p95 rising from 18 ms at 09:10 UTC to 760 ms at 09:18 UTC and 810 ms at 09:21 UTC. The panel's displayed query is `region=eu-west-1, service=*`, and its legend says `all payments clients`. The panel has no request IDs or per-service breakdown. The database's total connection count remains below its configured limit.\n\nThe dashboard alone does not show which client experienced the long waits or whether the checkout requests reached a database client.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"run/evidence/02-database-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1791433830411,"end":1791433830425}},"id":"prt_119c6ef93001j1MU1XPcwo6efo","sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","messageID":"msg_119c6e8570015Q0G1ogcITISRI"}}
