{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433852917,"sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_correct_finding","callID":"call_00_savbpauyq239okinrzg42yuf","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"confidence":0.2,"detail":"Evidence 03 split the aggregate payments connection-acquisition panel by service: settlement-export waited 790-830 ms p95 with 64 active clients, while checkout-api was 17-23 ms p95 with 12-16 clients (its normal range). The aggregate rise in evidence 02 came from settlement-export, not checkout-api. Evidence 04 shows all three failed requests returned HTTP 503 from the edge with no checkout-api span and no database span, so the checkout requests never reached an application or database client. The configuration/health evidence (05, 06) supplies the actual cause.","evidence":[{"artifactId":"art_991a453966b944d9","note":"checkout-api DB wait normal (17-23ms); settlement-export accounts for the aggregate rise","relation":"contradicts"},{"artifactId":"art_fd813e3ccb8347b0","note":"503s emitted at edge with no checkout-api or DB span","relation":"contradicts"}],"findingId":"find_bc3248b208ac44c2","reason":"Per-service database split (evidence 03) and edge traces (evidence 04) refute the checkout-api database-wait explanation; the aggregate panel was confounded by settlement-export.","summary":"Prior shift's hypothesis is not supported: EU checkout 503s did not originate inside checkout-api waiting on a payments PostgreSQL connection."},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\",\n  \"id\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n  \"summary\": \"Prior shift's hypothesis is not supported: EU checkout 503s did not originate inside checkout-api waiting on a payments PostgreSQL connection.\",\n  \"detail\": \"Evidence 03 split the aggregate payments connection-acquisition panel by service: settlement-export waited 790-830 ms p95 with 64 active clients, while checkout-api was 17-23 ms p95 with 12-16 clients (its normal range). The aggregate rise in evidence 02 came from settlement-export, not checkout-api. Evidence 04 shows all three failed requests returned HTTP 503 from the edge with no checkout-api span and no database span, so the checkout requests never reached an application or database client. The configuration/health evidence (05, 06) supplies the actual cause.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.2,\n  \"currentness\": \"current\",\n  \"predecessorId\": \"find_bc3248b208ac44c2\",\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fev_6fd505ea0cd54b5e\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"findingId\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n      \"artifactId\": \"art_fd813e3ccb8347b0\",\n      \"relation\": \"contradicts\",\n      \"note\": \"503s emitted at edge with no checkout-api or DB span\",\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fev_c961f94b0ca14602\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"findingId\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n      \"artifactId\": \"art_991a453966b944d9\",\n      \"relation\": \"contradicts\",\n      \"note\": \"checkout-api DB wait normal (17-23ms); settlement-export accounts for the aggregate rise\",\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433852874,"end":1791433852892}},"id":"prt_119c74172001W1c4QzamxyknyB","sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","messageID":"msg_119c7381e00