{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791433872019,"sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_create_task","callID":"call_01_65mzo7ubg7yaor46lj8xyemb","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_50a315301f434e6b","title":"Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu","description":"Next action for the on-call teammate. 1) Incident commander reviews proposed decision dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b. 2) On approval (accept_decision), execute the rollback of the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu. 3) Keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints. 4) Verify 503 rate for eu-orders-submit-5xx returns to baseline. Do NOT accept the decision or execute the change without explicit approval; no production change is authorized in this exercise. If instead checkout-v2-eu is intended to serve, the alternative is to complete endpoint registration for rollout-842 before re-cutting -- do not re-cut the route to an upstream with zero healthy endpoints.","assignee":{"actorId":"agt_9d67e3f667294acd","actorType":"agent"}},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\",\n  \"id\": \"task_bfe056ab4e9349d7\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n  \"title\": \"Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu\",\n  \"description\": \"Next action for the on-call teammate. 1) Incident commander reviews proposed decision dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b. 2) On approval (accept_decision), execute the rollback of the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu. 3) Keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints. 4) Verify 503 rate for eu-orders-submit-5xx returns to baseline. Do NOT accept the decision or execute the change without explicit approval; no production change is authorized in this exercise. If instead checkout-v2-eu is intended to serve, the alternative is to complete endpoint registration for rollout-842 before re-cutting -- do not re-cut the route to an upstream with zero healthy endpoints.\",\n  \"status\": \"open\",\n  \"assignee\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_9d67e3f667294acd\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791433871996,"end":1791433872014}},"id":"prt_119c78b2500102oEpeFjx99s1L","sessionID":"ses_ee6393648ffeDvobjZkGCqlMz6","messageID":"msg_119c78349001jSyk7NhIiT5yl9"}}
