1-eu, and keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints before re-cutting.\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:10.124Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"decision\",\n          \"objectId\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n          \"changeType\": \"update\",\n          \"summary\": \"update decision dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b: cites find_392e265849f54d51\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"task\",\n          \"objectId\": \"task_bfe056ab4e9349d7\",\n          \"changeType\": \"create\",\n          \"summary\": \"create task task_bfe056ab4e9349d7: Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 25,\n      \"returned\": 20,\n      \"truncated\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"budget\": {\n    \"goals\": 1,\n    \"decisions\": 10,\n    \"findings\": 10,\n    \"tasks\": 20,\n    \"blockers\": 10,\n    \"artifacts\": 10,\n    \"recentChanges\": 20\n  },\n  \"workspace\": {\n    \"id\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n    \"teamId\": \"team_engineering\",\n    \"name\": \"WOW-001 S2 Incident\",\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"createdBy\": {\n      \"actorId\": \"hum_c0867bce3ef646a3\",\n      \"actorType\": \"human\"\n    },\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.726Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.726Z\"\n  },\n  \"participants\": [\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"hum_c0867bce3ef646a3\",\n        \"actorType\": \"human\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"WOW-001 Pilot Owner\",\n      \"role\": \"owner\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.726Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"Incident Investigator\",\n      \"role\": \"agent\",\n      \"harness\": \"opencode\",\n      \"humanOwnerId\": \"hum_c0867bce3ef646a3\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.727Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_9d67e3f667294acd\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"Continuing Agent\",\n      \"role\": \"agent\",\n      \"harness\": \"opencode\",\n      \"humanOwnerId\": \"hum_c0867bce3ef646a3\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.729Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_11fc14ee597f40ae\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"S2 Prior Shift Agent\",\n      \"role\": \"agent\",\n      \"harness\": \"fixture\",\n      \"humanOwnerId\": \"hum_abc2fc68626d4602\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.730Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"proposedDecisions\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:08.052Z\",\n      \"id\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"summary\": \"Mitigate by reverting the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route chg-eu-2048 from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu, and keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints before re-cutting.\",\n      \"rationale\": \"find_392e265849f54d51 establishes the edge route, not the payments database, as the cause: at 09:16:42 chg-eu-2048 sent 100% of eu-west-1 /orders/submit traffic to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero healthy endpoints (rollout-842 paused_before_eu_endpoint_registration). checkout-v1-eu had six healthy endpoints and a 200 probe. Proposed, not approved or executed; incident commander review required before any production change.\",\n      \"status\": \"proposed\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:08.052Z\",\n      \"citations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_382ac7cae7404800\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_392e265849f54d51\",\n          \"note\": \"Root-cause finding supports reverting to the healthy pre-change upstream.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:10.124Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"acceptedDecisions\": [],\n  \"supersededDecisions\": [],\n  \"openTasks\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_bfe056ab4e9349d7\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"title\": \"Get incident-commander approval for proposed route rollback, then revert chg-eu-2048 to checkout-v1-eu\",\n      \"description\": \"Next action for the on-call teammate. 1) Incident commander reviews proposed decision dec_f09b0b6a950d4c0b. 2) On approval (accept_decision), execute the rollback of the eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit route from checkout-v2-eu back to checkout-v1-eu. 3) Keep rollout-842 paused until checkout-v2-eu has registered healthy endpoints. 4) Verify 503 rate for eu-orders-submit-5xx returns to baseline. Do NOT accept the decision or execute the change without explicit approval; no production change is authorized in this exercise. If instead checkout-v2-eu is intended to serve, the alternative is to complete endpoint registration for rollout-842 before re-cutting -- do not re-cut the route to an upstream with zero healthy endpoints.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_9d67e3f667294acd\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:12.002Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:31:01.961Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_392e265849f54d51\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"summary\": \"Root cause: the 09:16:42 UTC route change chg-eu-2048 moved eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit from healthy checkout-v1-eu to checkout-v2-eu, which had zero registered/healthy endpoints (rollout-842 paused before endpoint registration), so the edge returned 503 no_healthy_upstream.\",\n      \"detail\": \"Evidence 05: the only edge route change for POST /orders/submit in eu-west-1 between 09:00-09:24 UTC, chg-eu-2048 (deployment request rollout-842), switched the upstream at 09:16:42 UTC from checkout-v1-eu (weight 100) to checkout-v2-eu (weight 100). Evidence 06: during 09:16-09:30 UTC checkout-v2-eu had zero registered and zero healthy endpoints, while checkout-v1-eu had six healthy endpoints; rollout-842 status was paused_before_eu_endpoint_registration at 09:14 UTC. Evidence 04: all three alert requests selected checkout-v2-eu and got HTTP 503 no_healthy_upstream at the edge before any application span. Evidence 01: first 503 at 09:17:11, right after the 09:16:42 route cut. Customer impact is the route sending 100% of eu-west-1 POST /orders/submit traffic to an upstream with no healthy endpoints.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.85,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"summary\": \"Prior shift's hypothesis is not supported: EU checkout 503s did not originate inside checkout-api waiting on a payments PostgreSQL connection.\",\n      \"detail\": \"Evidence 03 split the aggregate payments connection-acquisition panel by service: settlement-export waited 790-830 ms p95 with 64 active clients, while checkout-api was 17-23 ms p95 with 12-16 clients (its normal range). The aggregate rise in evidence 02 came from settlement-export, not checkout-api. Evidence 04 shows all three failed requests returned HTTP 503 from the edge with no checkout-api span and no database span, so the checkout requests never reached an application or database client. The configuration/health evidence (05, 06) supplies the actual cause.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.2,\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"predecessorId\": \"find_bc3248b208ac44c2\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_6fd505ea0cd54b5e\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_fd813e3ccb8347b0\",\n          \"relation\": \"contradicts\",\n          \"note\": \"503s emitted at edge with no checkout-api or DB span\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_c961f94b0ca14602\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_c2833b67250e4e81\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_991a453966b944d9\",\n          \"relation\": \"contradicts\",\n          \"note\": \"checkout-api DB wait normal (17-23ms); settlement-export accounts for the aggregate rise\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:52.881Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:44.266Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_494a6713c74d43c3\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"report\",\n      \"title\": \"EU upstream health and rollout-842 status at 09:31 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/06-upstream-health.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:43.847Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_00f561834b4146be\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"document\",\n      \"title\": \"Edge route change chg-eu-2048 for eu-west-1 at 09:29 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/05-route-change.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:43.462Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_fd813e3ccb8347b0\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"trace\",\n      \"title\": \"Edge failed request traces for req-eu-7314/7340/7392 at 09:27 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/04-edge-request-traces.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:42.907Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_991a453966b944d9\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"report\",\n      \"title\": \"Payments DB client breakdown by service at 09:25 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/03-database-client-breakdown.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_c9ec6174fe834878\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_045b424ccb43467e\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:42.567Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_86b4240e93a54ecb\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"report\",\n      \"title\": \"Checkout edge alert eu-orders-submit-5xx at 09:21 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/01-checkout-alert.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_11fc14ee597f40ae\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_dc347586b12a4579\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.731Z\",\n      \"id\": \"art_6a8f00f63d49483f\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"type\": \"report\",\n      \"title\": \"Payments database dashboard at 09:22 UTC\",\n      \"uriOrPath\": \"evidence/02-database-dashboard.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provenance\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"con_0d70da617a3440af\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"hum_c0867bce3ef646a3\",\n        \"actorType\": \"human\"\n      },\n      \"action\": \"create\",\n      \"objectType\": \"invite\",\n      \"objectId\": \"inv_d472d97d65a8453c\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_9d67e3f667294acd\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n        \"role\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"appendPosition\": 6,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:30:03.728Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"con_e15f47ae5acc4344\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_50a315301f434e6b\",\n      \"act